□[0s,∞) {"../Lex/example/GDPR/gdpr.lex:1442:1-1450:45"}{∀c. ∀ds. (∃a. ∃d. ∃de. ∃pr. ((DataProcessing(pr, c, a, d) ∧ IsCollection(a, ds)) ∧ PersonalData(d, ds)) ∧ HasIntendedAutomatedDecision(d, de)) →:R ⧫[0s,∞) (∃de. ∃re. Inform(c, ds, de) ∧:L Contains(de, re) ∧:L IsAutomatedDecision(re))}